{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"申命記","commonName":"申命記","title":"申命記","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"5c99d640766f4ea11b4ca8e01cfd5ad9c5deadc5b6eb8918cde0bde55312a45e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":949},"chapter":{"number":34,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西去世"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["摩西從摩押平原登上尼波山，上到耶利哥對面的毗斯迦山頂。耶和華把整片土地指給他看，從基列一直到但，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["拿弗他利全境，以法蓮和瑪拿西地區，遠至地中海的猶大全境，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["南地和棕櫚城耶利哥的谷地，遠至瑣珥。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華對摩西說：「這便是我向亞伯拉罕、以撒和雅各起誓要賜給他們子孫的土地。現在我讓你親眼看到了，但你不能進入。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是，耶和華的僕人摩西死在摩押，正如耶和華所言。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華把他安葬在摩押境內伯·毗珥對面的山谷，至今無人知道摩西的墳墓在哪裡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西去世時一百二十歲，眼睛沒有昏花，精力沒有衰敗。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["以色列人在摩押平原為摩西致哀三十天，服喪的日子才結束。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["嫩的兒子約書亞充滿了智慧之靈，因為摩西曾把手按在他身上。以色列人都聽從他，遵守耶和華對摩西的吩咐。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["此後，以色列再也沒有出現像摩西那樣的先知，他曾面見耶和華，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["奉耶和華的命令在埃及行神蹟奇事，懲罰法老及其臣僕和國民，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["在以色列人面前行偉大而可畏的事。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/34.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DEU/33.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}